</code></pre></div>

<p>This was because I didn't have a notification daemon in my <code>i3</code> based
setup. Searching the bug track lead me to <a href="https://github.com/signalapp/Signal-Desktop/issues/4653">this
issue</a> which
suggested either disabling notifications in the app, or installing a
notification daemon. Since I find <em>not</em> having notification an awesome
feature of any desktop or phone, I went ahead and disabled the
notifications in the <code>File</code> → <code>Preferences...</code> dialogue.</p>
<p><img
  class="centered"
